  {
   "id": "t_9e4d8081a86e5cdd217e",
   "sourceHash": "9e4d8081a86e5cdd217ee106a128e1097f6de468d1af12aeec92248d33ce394c",
   "text": "कैरली पालक्काड, केरल के सर्वश्रेष्ठ होम स्टे और दुनिया के श्रेष्ठ वेलनेस केंद्रों में से एक है। यहाँ का पर्यावरण-अनुकूल परिवेश आपको यादगार अनुभव देगा।",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Shortened to fit the 155-character seo.description limit (about 150 chars). The full brand name was cut to 'कैरली' and 'of your lifetime' was simplified. The source's 'best in the world' / 'best home stays' claims are kept but not strengthened. They are unverified marketing claims, and 'home stays' / 'wellness centers' sit outside the clinical register, so owner review is recommended."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_16dcbaf2a8d3ce0df862",
