   "text": "–",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Concat fragment between two dates ('Valid DATE to DATE'). Hindi puts 'से … तक' around the dates, which a fixed concat order can't produce, so a range dash is used ('मान्य DATE – DATE'). A developer could restructure the string instead."
   ]
